{"type":"message","id":"fd1ba454","parentId":"c8fff7ea","timestamp":"2026-05-17T06:09:13.589Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me wait for this.\n\nActually, given the consistent pattern of failure, I think the best approach here is to give a clear summary to the user. The Worker is hitting CPU limits on every invocation, and this is a server-side issue. The previous heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC (about 6 hours ago), and despite multiple retries with increasing delays, the POST /send endpoint continues to return error 1101.\n\nLet me wait for this last attempt.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-1785d589-4778-4d06-a001-75685c363059","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","timeout":65000,"sessionId":"quiet-comet"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":154,"output":144,"cacheRead":21056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21354,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778998138173,"responseId":"chatcmpl-75170c5a-9761-42c3-9b70-8ee448282360"}}
