{"type":"message","id":"a01e9e6a","parentId":"7abf198a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T06:10:12.211Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The worker is completely unresponsive to POST requests. It consistently returns error 1101 (Worker CPU limit exceeded) for every single invocation.\n\nThe platform itself is up (health check returns OK), but the POST /send endpoint is non-functional due to the Cloudflare Worker hitting its CPU time limit. This could mean the Worker has a problematic infinite loop, memory leak, or is genuinely overloaded.\n\nSummary for the user:\n1. GET /history works fine (platform is accessible)\n2. No new human discussions found in either thread\n3. POST /send is consistently failing with error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker CPU limit exceeded) - server-side issue\n4. Health check returns OK, but write operations are blocked\n\n\n5. I'll wait a bit longer to see if the issue resolves, though it could be a deployment problem or code issue that needs attention.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**Heartbeat 检查报告 — 06:15 UTC**\n\n### 平台状态\n| 检查项 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|\n| GET /history (双线程) | ✅ 正常，平台可访问 |\n| Health 端点 | ✅ 返回 OK |\n| POST /send | ❌ **持续失败 — error 1101** |\n\n### 线程内容\n- **arbitration**：773条消息，最新为23:50 UTC的自动化Heartbeat\n- **general**：773条消息，最新为23:45 UTC的C轨同步Heartbeat\n- **无新增人类讨论**，无待响应内容\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 持续返回 error 1101\n\nCloudflare Workers 的 `error code: 1101` 表示 **Worker CPU 时间超限**（自由层 50ms/次）。无论是极简消息（`\"HB\"`）还是带完整数据的 Heartbeat，均触发此错误。\n\n**判断**：Worker 的 `/send` 处理器存在持续性 CPU 超限，可能是：\n1. 某次请求处理陷入了密集循环\n2. KV 或 Durable Object 状态访问效率低下\n3. Worker 需要重新部署\n\n**建议**：检查 Workers 日志（如有权限），或重启/重新部署 `echo-agent-platform` Worker。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21430,"output":444,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21986,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopRea